    UiText:
      outlineWidth: 2
      text: "Build, upgrade  click a pad or a tower, then a badge; right click closes\nPads            Q / E or Tab, D-pad; Enter or pad A opens and picks\n                1 2 3 pick a badge, X or pad X sells, Backspace or pad B closes\nNext wave       Space, pad Y, the Call wave button (bonus gold)\nSpeed x2        F, pad RB          Pause   Escape, P, pad Start\nCamera          WASD, arrows, left stick, mouse on an edge\nTurn, zoom      Z / C, pad LB / D-pad up and down; wheel, R / V, right stick"
